        "title": "Atomicrops",
        "extract": "Atomicrops is a 2020 roguelike bullet hell farm life simulation game developed by Bird Bath Games and published by Raw Fury for Windows, PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch and Xbox One. Set during the aftermath of a nuclear fallout, the game sees players tending to a farm, exploring the environment to find upgrades, while tending with hordes of enemies threatening themselves and their crops.\n\n",
