        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Alentejo: The Tinto and The Ugly",
        "extract": "Alentejo: The Tinto & The Ugly is an RPG game released in 2025 and developed by Loading Studios and published by Teknamic Software for Game Boy, PC and Web browser. The game is the sequel to Alentejo: Tinto's Law, inspired in Spaghetti Western movies of the 1960s.\nThe narrative follows Gildo and Dolores after the events of the previous game. The Game Boy version marks the first commercially released sequel developed in Portugal to be launched for that platform.\n\n",
